{title: I don’t know what you came to do}

{comment: Chorus}
I don’t know what you came to do, but I came to praise the Lord
I don’t know what you came to do, but I came to praise the Lord
I don’t know what you came to do, but I came to praise the Lord
Hallelu, Hallelu, Hallelujah

{comment: Chorus 2}
You can sit on a pew if you want to, but I came to praise the Lord
You can sit on a pew if you want to, but I came to praise the Lord
You can sit on a pew if you want to, but I came to praise the Lord
Hallelu, Hallelu, Hallelujah
